    "scenesThatPass": [
      "HELEN: Walking is fine. You don’t want to twist your little horsey ankles, do you?\nMARTHA: We'll walk for a bit. You show a lot of promise for a career girl.\nHELEN: Thanks. You’re a terrific liar.",
      "MARTHA: All right. I’m sorry. Never mind. If you have to go, you have to go. I only...Look at the time. We need to get back for church.\nHELEN: Go, go after her.",
      "MARTHA: Well, look at you. You’re putting me to shame.\nHELEN: Is this too much for church? I checked with Jackson and --\nMARTHA: Not at all. I envy your confidence.\nHELEN: Are you sure?",
      "HELEN: After you.\nMARTHA: Go ahead. Really.",
      "HELEN: What a beautiful service.\nMARTHA: Yes, it was. Wasn’t it? Well, it’s late. I’ll say good night."
    ]
  },
